course: dictionary
lesson: 1406
title: Cardboard, the material and the meaning
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Cardboard is thick, stiff paper. It is stiff enough to hold its shape, so people use it to make boxes, packaging and models. «The girl has built a cardboard castle» tells you the castle was made from cardboard, not stone.
explain: In a story, a cardboard character is one who seems flat and not real. The example sentence says the Knave is «who is made of cardboard», which means he seems like a paper cut-out, not a real person. Writers use this to show a character who does not feel alive.
explain: Look at the words near cardboard to find its meaning. «A cardboard box», «a cardboard tube» and «corrugated cardboard» all name real things you can hold. «Recycle it after» is a clue that cardboard is something you put in the recycling.
fact: Cardboard is thick, stiff paper used for boxes, packaging and models.
fact: Cardboard is made from wood pulp, and it is light and can be recycled.
fact: Cardboard is made by running paper through hot ridged rollers to make a wavy layer, then gluing it between flat sheets.
fact: Cardboard is weak when wet, so keep it dry if you are using it for a project.
fact: A cardboard character in a story seems flat and not real.
exercise: The girl «has built a cardboard castle». What material was the castle made of? | Sand | Stone | Glass | *Cardboard
exercise: In a story, a cardboard character seems what? | Fast and clever | Very loud and noisy | *Flat and not real | Made of wood and metal
exercise: Cardboard is weak when wet. What does this tell you? | It is always stronger in rain | It is made of metal | *It can get soggy and fall apart | It cannot be recycled
test: What is cardboard usually used to make? | Bicycles | *Boxes | Shoes | Windows
test: Where should you put cardboard after you have finished with it? | In the sea | Under your bed | Up a tree | *In the recycling
exam: In «a cardboard castle», what does the word cardboard tell you? | *The castle is made of cardboard | The castle is made of stone | The castle is very tall | The castle is very old
